      "content": "I hear how incredibly exhausting and overwhelming that feeling of being stuck must be for you, and it makes complete sense that you've reached a breaking point after trying so hard. The reality is that none of us are born \"broken,\" but life's struggles can sometimes make us feel like we can't escape a darkness that seems deeper than it actually is. To know that this cycle of trying and returning to the same place is leaving you feeling empty doesn't mean you aren't salvageable or worth saving, yet it might help to pause and seek support from a mental health professional who can offer new tools for navigating this specific pain.",
